      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Fifty percent human placental hydroalcoholic extract was used topically on 34 vitiligo patients. Complete clearing of lesions was seen in 20.6% cases, whereas 50% cases showed mild to moderate improvement, and 29.4% showed no response. No serious side effects were seen in any of the patients."},
